{"book":"2-kings","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-30T00:15:13.061813306Z","verse":26,"ref":"2-kings 17:26","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":17,"translation":"And they spoke to the king of Assyria, saying, “The nations that you exiled and settled in the cities of Samaria do not know ⟨את⟩ the judgment of the Elohim of the land, so he sent among them ⟨את⟩ the lions, and behold, they are killing them, because they do not know ⟨את⟩ the judgment of the Elohim of the land.”","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמרו","gloss":"And they said"},{"surface":"למלך","gloss":"to the king"},{"surface":"אשור","gloss":"of Assyria"},{"surface":"לאמר","gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"הגוים","gloss":"The nations"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"whom"},{"surface":"הגלית","gloss":"you exiled"},{"surface":"ותושב","gloss":"and settled"},{"surface":"בערי","gloss":"in the cities"},{"surface":"שמרון","gloss":"of Samaria"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"do not"},{"surface":"ידעו","gloss":"do…know"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the judgment"},{"surface":"משפט","gloss":"the judgment"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"of the Elohim"},{"surface":"הארץ","gloss":"of the land"},{"surface":"וישלח","gloss":"so he sent"},{"surface":"בם","gloss":"among them"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the lions"},{"surface":"האריות","gloss":"the lions"},{"surface":"והנם","gloss":"and behold"},{"surface":"ממיתים","gloss":"they are killing"},{"surface":"אותם","gloss":"⟨את⟩ them"},{"surface":"כאשר","gloss":"because"},{"surface":"אינם","gloss":"they do not"},{"surface":"ידעים","gloss":"know"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the judgment"},{"surface":"משפט","gloss":"the judgment"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"of the Elohim"},{"surface":"הארץ","gloss":"of the land"}]}